B.yW=new A.bv(B.Zt,["English","Enduro","Trail","Downhill","All Mountain","Gravel","Cross Country","E-Bike","Sign-in processed","You can close this window and return to the app.","Sign-in incomplete","Please return to the app and try again.","The saved data could not be loaded safely. It has not been overwritten. Do not clear the app data; please contact support.","{front}F / {rear}R mm","{count} bikes","Bike backup","The backup exceeds 50 MB.","Login","Code: {code}","Enter valid limits and step size.","Enter valid limits and step size. Whole numbers only.","Minimum","Maximum","The sign-in proof is missing, invalid or expired. Start and finish in the same browser. On iPhone, open the app directly in Safari and retry there. Do not clear existing app data.","This Google account is already linked to an app account. Choose \u201cLogin\u201d to open your existing account. Your guest data is kept until you decide what to do with it.","Enable Allow manual linking in Supabase Auth settings.","Google sign-in did not complete. Cancel and retry. If it fails again, report the diagnostic code below.","More features","Basics","Close tour","Skip","Next","Privacy policy","Step size","Remove range","Outside range","Your own bike","Database or manual entry","**Search a model** \u2192 choose a bike database suggestion. Not listed? **Enter model and brand yourself.**","Rename changes the name; Duplicate creates a copy. Deletion is disabled during the tour.","Back to tour","Press and hold a setup","**Press and hold** \u2192 rename or duplicate. Then close the menu.","Open setup","**Tap the setup** \u2192 open its settings.","Mark favorites","**Tap the star** \u2192 favorite. Favorites stay first. Tap again to remove.","Tour complete","Add your own bike next. Your first setup includes a short guide to tracking values, custom fields and categories.","Add my bike","Please restart the tour.","Choose your values","**Track only what you need.** Select PSI, clicks, tokens and more.","Set adjustment ranges","Set **minimum, maximum and step size** to match your component.","Add a custom field","**Missing a value?** Use + to add your own field.","Add a custom category","**Beyond suspension and tires.** Add a category such as \u201cDropper Post\u201d.","Your first setup","Add adjustment range","Value must match the range and step size","Change and save a value","**Tap value \u2192 change \u2192 Save.** The change stays on the demo bike.","Basics complete","You can now add your own bike. Your first setup includes a short guide to tracking values and custom fields. Or explore more features first.","Explore more","Parameters per setup","**This sliders icon** opens parameter selection. Choose which values to track **separately for each setup**.","Open ordering","**Tap the arrows** \u2192 ordering mode. Switching setups is locked while ordering.","Move a field","**Hold, drag and release a field.**","Finish ordering","**Tap Done.** Apply the order here or to all demo setups.","Review changes","**Before \u2192 After** with an optional note. Find your changes here.","Swipe between setups","**Swipe left or right.** On a PC: drag with the left mouse button held.","Could not start the tour. Please try again.","After you tap \u201cLet\u2019s go\u201d, a guest account is created and your data is saved automatically in a private cloud. Link Google under Account & backup to restore access after losing your device.","Account & backup","Edit also lets you rename the bike. Deletion is disabled during the tour.","Your backup needs attention.","View","Remember your backup","Your first bike is ready! Check Account & backup and link your account so you can restore your data if you lose your device.","Later","Manage bikes","**Press and hold** \u2192 bike menu. Then close it. Practice on the demo bike.","Open bike","**Tap the bike** \u2192 open its setups.","What should happen to your guest data?","After successful Google sign-in, the old guest account is deleted. Imported data is fully synced first.","Import data as copies","Export backup","Discard guest data","Discard guest data?","After successful sign-in, the old guest account, its cloud data and local backups are deleted. Exported files remain.","Permanently delete account?","Your app account, cloud data, images, previous versions and this account\u2019s local backups will be deleted. Your Google account remains. Exported files and copies on other devices remain. Provider backups follow their retention periods. This cannot be undone.","Type DELETE to confirm","Delete permanently","The operation did not complete. Please check your connection and entries. Details: {error}","Import backup?","Bikes will be added as new copies. Existing bikes are retained.","Confirm","Previous cloud versions","No previous versions yet.","Close","Restore version?","This version becomes current. The current local data is backed up first.","Local backups","No backups yet.","Separately saved account data","Restore as copies?","These bikes will be added to the current workspace.","Bike order","Custom field library","Deleted bike","Cloud synced; Google sign-in pending.","Google sign-in could not be matched or expired. Please cancel and sign in again.","Syncing data \u2026","Synced with cloud","Conflicting changes \u2013 choose a version","Cloud setup is incomplete: check SQL migration and access rules.","Session missing. Please sign in again. Local data is retained.","Unable to authenticate. Check connection and anonymous sign-ins in Supabase.","Local save failed. Please check free storage.","Backup pending. Connection or cloud service unavailable; retrying automatically.","Backup pending","Bikes loaded. Some photos are still unavailable and will be retried.","Bikes synced. Image cleanup will be retried.","Delete account","Your account has been deleted. No new guest account is created until you start again.","Account deletion has started. Sync is blocked. If the connection fails, retry deletion.","Export local data","Start again as guest","Retry deletion","You are using the app as a guest","Your saved session is no longer valid. The account may have been deleted outside the app. Your local data is still available.","Reconnect local data?","A new guest account will be created and your existing local data uploaded to it. You can then link Google or sign in.","Reconnect local data","Last sync","Bikes, setups and images are saved locally and automatically to your private cloud.","Link Google to regain access after losing a device or clearing app data. Anonymous sign-in alone cannot provide this.","Sync now","Conflicts","Both versions are retained until you choose. A local backup is created before resolving.","Conflict copy","Keep both versions","Keep local version","Use cloud version","Google is connected","Your account","Already have an account?","Sign in with Google to access your saved bikes and setups. First choose what happens to your guest data.","Register","New here? Keep your bikes safe.","Create your app account with Google. Your existing bikes and setups are kept and linked to your account. No extra password needed.","Google is linked. Sign in with the same Google account on other devices.","Complete Google sign-in in the browser and return to the app. If this Google account is already linked elsewhere, cancel and choose Login.","Cancel Google sign-in","Sign out?","Your local account data is retained separately. Unsynced changes exist only on this device.","Sign out","Google is optional. You can keep using the app as a guest.","Clean up previous guest account","Guest data is being synced. The old guest account is deleted afterwards.","The old guest account could not be deleted yet. Your Google data remains. Retry; if this persists, the guest data needs review.","Retry","Backup files","An exported file contains your bikes, setups and images. Keep it somewhere safe outside this device.","Export","Import","Cloud versions","Permanently removes your app account and its data. Export a backup first if you want to keep your data.","Export backup first","Delete account and data","Reorder setups","Drag setups into your preferred order. Favorites stay at the top.","My Bikes","Mark as favorite","Remove favorite","Reorder bikes","Hold a bike card and drag it into position. Favorites stay at the top. Changes are saved automatically.","Done","Settings","Colors & appearance","Choose a palette color or enter a hex value. Valid entries are saved immediately. The checkmark shows your current color.","Apply color","Choose color","Tap or drag on the palette to choose your color.","Hue","Saturation","Brightness","Background color","Accent color","Preview your colors","Reset colors","Custom color (hex)","Enter 6 hex characters, e.g. 009688.","Language","New Bike","Search brand or model...","Tutorial / Information","No bikes found.","Add new Bike","Choose from Database","Pre-configured top models with suspension specs","Create manually","Enter brand, model, and travel yourself","New Bike","Add Cover Photo","Change Cover Photo","Brand","Model (Tap to search database)","e.g. Megatower","Category","Front Travel (mm)","Rear Travel (mm)","Save Bike","Specs applied for","!","New Setup","add new Setup","Configure Suspension","Rename","Duplicate","Delete Setup?","Do you really want to delete the setup ","? This action cannot be undone.","Bike not found","New Name","(Copy)","Front","Rear","details","Fork","Shock","Tires","Front tire model","Front tire pressure","Rear tire model","Rear tire pressure","History","Delete history","Delete history?","Do you really want to delete the entire history of this setup? This cannot be undone. The current setup values will be kept.","Notes","General remarks (e.g., trail conditions, weather...)","No adjustments recorded yet.","New Value","Reason (Optional)","e.g. more support...","What is this?","Got it","Not set","Air","Setup name","e.g. Schladming","Please enter a name.","Create setup","FORK SETTINGS","SHOCK TYPE","SHOCK SETTINGS","TIRES","Main Air Pressure","2nd Chamber / OTT","High-Speed Comp. (HSC)","Low-Speed Comp. (LSC)","High-Speed Rebound (HSR)","Low-Speed Rebound (LSR)","Tokens (Spacers)","Hydraulic Bottom-Out (HBO)","Air","Coil","Air Pressure","Spring Rate","Preload","Main","Neg/OTT","Tokens","Spring","Preload","{component}: {field}","Clicks","Pieces","Turns","PSI/Clicks","Low-Speed Compression: Controls compression during slow suspension movements (e.g. pedaling, braking, berms). More LSC = more support, less = more traction.","High-Speed Compression: Absorbs fast, harsh impacts (e.g. root sections, big rocks, hard landings).","Low-Speed Rebound: Controls the extension speed after normal bumps. Too fast = bike bounces, too slow = suspension packs down.","High-Speed Rebound: Controls extension after deep compressions to prevent the rear end from bucking on jumps.","Determines the baseline stiffness (sag) of the suspension based on rider weight.","Volume Spacers: Alter bottom-out resistance. More tokens = harder to bottom out.","Hydraulic Bottom-Out: Extra hydraulic resistance at the very end of the stroke.","Off The Top: Regulates initial stroke sensitivity without affecting mid/end stroke.","The stiffness of the coil spring, chosen based on rider weight.","Coil spring preload. Warning: Do not use it to adjust sag (max. 2\u20133 turns)!","Track Tires & Pressure","Save Configuration","Save Changes","Setup Configuration","Shock type for this setup","Unsaved changes","You changed the configuration. Save it before leaving this screen.","Keep editing","Discard","Show notes field","Edit field","Delete field from library","Delete field?","The field and its saved values will be removed from every bike and setup.","Number","Text","Yes / No","Yes","No","Custom field","Delete category","Delete category?","The category, including all fields and saved values, will also be removed from every other bike and setup. To only hide the fields, deactivate them in the respective bike or setup instead.","Rename category","Arrange fields","Done","Briefly hold and drag to move","Hold and drag to move the category","Briefly hold a field and drag it to the desired position within its category. To move an entire category, hold and drag its heading or the handle next to it.","Apply field order?","Apply this order to the other setups of this bike as well? Values and enabled fields will stay unchanged.","Only this setup","Apply to all","Add new category","Change unit","Unit","Default","New category","Category name","Create","Add custom field","Field name","Value type","None","Custom unit","Add","Notes about {category} \u2026","Setup not found","Edit Bike","Model","Delete Bike","Delete Bike?","Delete this bike and its setups? Its photos will also be deleted after syncing unless another bike needs them. Older cloud versions can still be restored without these photos.","Required","Error","Cancel","Save","Delete","Welcome to Bike Setup Tracker! \ud83d\udeb2","I have created a demo bike for you so you can try out the features right away.","Long-press a bike card on the home screen to open the menu. Choose to edit or delete the bike, or reorder your bikes.","Let's go!"],t.li)
